      <p>One named operator with a finance reviewer. Agency-heavy decisions without internal ownership are the most common pattern behind stacks that grow instead of improve.</p>
      </article>
    <FaqSection faqs={faqs} />
    <p class="mt-12 text-slate-300">Continue with the <a class="link" href="/apps">app profiles</a>, <a class="link" href="/use-cases">Shopify use cases</a>, and <a class="link" href="/guides">operator guides</a>.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
